      "text": "It’s amazing how local communities preserve food using simple techniques. But I’m curious, how long can the smoked fish actually be stored without refrigeration?",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T03:23:56Z",
      "replyCount": 2,
      "replies": [
        {
