          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/uc9cRNwmXGBLut6Pdn25rBdg4ef4yUU4SwGrpdAFL0fA2nV5VlC6RNR7RZUWN9ZO3EtZS9y8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "​@PlanetVista4KYeah, I’ve read that the layer of smoke helps keep oxygen and bacteria away, slowing down food spoilage. That’s why smoked food can last for such a long time.",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-11-08T05:41:18Z"
        },
